I'm both paranoid and cheap. :-) I have always maintained that I prefer DEC
disks for the system disk. There have been cases in the past, especially during
the V3 -> V4 transition, where third party drives didn't work on the new
software, and it took them a while to catch up. Or so I seem to remember. On the
