To find your little PDP11/03 computer inside your 780 or 785 open the
front doors and look in the lowest left corner. It hides just below
the floppy (RX01). There is a difference between a 780-PDP and a 785 ditto.
The 785 has more memory (I think it is like 4 K in the 780 and 32 in the
785 or so).
Now that you have found your PDP I say that making a new boot floppy is
a good thing to doo... :)

Motto of today: Inside every good old VAX is a little PDP11 who want to come
out...

/L. Persson, Harlosa PD computer centre.


